<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places 411 mln peso credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places 411 mln peso credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed its only credit auction for 411 million pesos on the secondary market on Thursday. The credit was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>   CREDIT AUCTION    TERM     MAXIMUM MINIMUM AVERAGE</p>
<p>     411  million pesos  1 day    24.60   24.43   24.56</p>
<p>The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
